{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1031562-typical-caucus-events","id":1031562,"title":"Typical Caucus events","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-14T06:58:07-08:00","id":1031562,"title":"Typical Caucus events","content":"From Order books we generally know what each Pentacle Order is doing. Still, we do not know how they their meeting look like or how they are organized events. This topic is for this reason.<br /> <br /> I remember each time I need to run particular Caucus scene, I needed to reinvent the wheel once more. So I want here to hammer generalities in Pentacle culture. It\u2019s all written with taking for granted that some Caucuses can change some of those things or their order ( pun intended :P ) on culture or events basis ( like dire situation with Seers terrorist assaults force everyone to talk right away on impending war ). I will edit this post if some ideas would be better shown in this topic. As always, comments are welcome. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">General Schema</span></b><br /> 1. Great Invocation to the most important dogmas/ideas of Order. Diamond invokes also their Dragon Symbology. [ Orders are (super)cults, in the end. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ]<br /> 2. Greetings of guests from other Caucuses or Orders ( if they are allowed ).<br /> 3. Official recognition on new members and promotions on titles and positions within Order.<br /> 4. Discussion of current situation over most important matters to Order mission.<br /> 5. Orders rituals or practices.<br /> 6. Sum up of actions done by Legacies connected to Order.<br /> 7. Unofficial part \u2013 party and networking, like sharing Rotes or Mentors.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Adamantine Arrow</span></b><br /> Arrows are most known Diamond Order to change their schema based on needing events or simply will of Adamant Sage.<br /> <br /> 1. Invocation of Arrows name, Talons of Dragon and Phalanx of Adamant Way. Example:<br /> <span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><i>\u2018We are Adamantine Arrow, Talons of Dragon from Atlantis that follow Adamant Way. Those are truths of the world: Existence Is War, Enlightenment Is Honor, Adaptability Is Strength, The Supernal Is the Self, Service Is Mastery.\u2019</i></span><br /> 2. Greetings of guests from other Caucuses or Orders ( if they are allowed ).<br /> 3. Official recognition on new members and promotions on titles and positions within Order.<br /> 4. Discussion of current conflicts situations in member Consillia. Planning defenses and attacks.<br /> 5. Publicly declaring Oaths ( even if technically taken before ). Vidantus Rites. Planning Great Games. (if any ).<br /> 6. Duel Arcane, especially for challenging over positions in Order.<br /> 7. Sum up of actions done by Legacies connected to Order.<br /> 8. Unofficial part \u2013 party and networking, like sharing Rotes or Mentors.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Guardians of the Veil</span></b><br /> Guardians meetings looks most likes secret societies gatherings. Every one wears mask based on their Shadow Name or Masques, so from outside they seems like masked ball. Often, locations are changing inside Caucus, to not rose suspition in Sleepers. There is strong mysteria-like feel to them, especially if introducing new mages from Labirynth.<br /> <br /> 1. ( If there is new mage to introduction ) Caucus meeting place (or any possible nearest ) is prepered as literal maze - will it be dungeon, caverns or even large hedge maze. Newest recruit needs to find heart of maze, with many Guardians in masks working as 'monsters'. When he gets to center, she is greated by Epopt as true Guardian and Caucus starts.<br /> 2. Invocation of Guardians name, Eyes of Dragon and Exoteric Tenens. Example:<br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">\u2018We are Guardians of the Veil, Eyes of Dragon from Atlantis that know the truths about Fallen World. Paradox Strengthens the Abyss. Punishment Answers Pride. Merit must guide the Fallen World. Sins for a just end grant Wisdom.'</span></i><br /> 3. Greetings of guests from other Caucuses or Orders ( if they are allowed ).<br /> 4. Promotions on titles and positions within Order.<br /> 5. Discussion of current threats in member Consillia - Abyssal Intrusions, Left-Hand mages, Seers of Throne.<br /> 6. Special rites ( if any needed ).<br /> 7. Sum up of actions done by Legacies connected to Order.<br /> 8. Unofficial part \u2013 party and networking, like sharing Rotes or Mentors.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Mysterium</span></b><br /> Almost all Mysterium meetings are done in one of Athenea of Caucus. They are fairly open in 'symposium' parts, being most inviting to non-members on those - even when Hierophant can limit access to non-members for particular parts.<br /> <br /> 1. Invocation of Mysterium name, Wings of Dragon and Egregore. Sometimes reading passages from Corpus Mysteriorum. Example:<br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">\u2018We are Mysterium, Wings of Dragon from Atlantis that guard Egregore. We came from Great Library of Alexandria and be till the end of times - same as Magic itself.'</span></i><br /> 2. Greetings of guests from other Caucuses or Orders ( if they are allowed ). Mysterium members from other Caucuses as treated 'as their own' ( if showing secret signs on itntroduction ).<br /> 3. Official recognition on new members and promotions on titles and positions within Order.<br /> 4. Discussion of current research state on Great Mysteries in member Consillia. Planning next expeditions to Temples of Time Before ( if any is organised ).<br /> 5. Special rites (if any needed ).<br /> 6. 'Symposium' - reading on discoveries in each Order's Disciplines from local Mystygouges. Hand over of new Grimoires and treaties to guesting Atheneum.<br /> 7. Sum up of actions done by Legacies connected to Order.<br /> 8. Unofficial part \u2013 party and networking, like sharing Rotes or Mentors.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Silver Ladder</span></b><br /> Tearchs meetings are eclectic mix of religious mass, political rally and lawyers convention. Some say they are good fun. Others are much mirror pointing it for 'old money party' feel. Rumors say it's the Tearchs invented Caucus meeting general format, rest of Diamond just copied from them. Silver Ladder likes to have symbolical throne in center of their meeting that is almost always empty. Members dress up and takes symbolic Yantras, mirroring their status and positions inside Order and Diamond.<br /> <br /> 1. Invocation of Ladder name, Voice of Dragon and Elemental Percepts . Example:<br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">\u2018We are Silver Ladder, Voice of Dragon from Atlantis that follow Elemental Percepts from beginnings of time. Those are truths of the world: Thunder: Imperium is the Sovereign Right of all Humanity. Diamond: The Awakened are One Nation. Blood: The Sleepers Follow. Star: The Silver Ladder is the Path to Victory</span></i><i><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">\u2019</span></i><br /> 2. Greetings of guests from other Caucuses or Orders ( if they are allowed ).<br /> 3. Official recognition on new members and promotions on titles and positions within Order. It is here when new member, after pledging to serve Awakened and Oracles, first and last time sits on the throne in the center.<br /> 4. Invocation of Oracles and divining their will in next Orders moves. Discussion on those omens and political situations in member Consillia. Analyzing Lex Magica in Consillia and plans of unifying them. Propositions on next near Convocation.<br /> 5. Invocation of Avatar in gathered, pointing to all having common God-Soul.<br /> 6. Sum up of actions done by Legacies connected to Order.<br /> 7. Unofficial part \u2013 party and networking, like sharing Rotes or Mentors.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Free Council</span></b><br /> Ironically, even if Free Council is other Sect, their Assembly meetings look a lot like Diamond ones. With less symbology and probably ending in much more hard rock concert than high spheres party, but similarities are obvious.<br /> <br /> 1. Invocation of Free Council proper name and Libertine Creed. Example:<br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">\u2018We are Free Assembly. Humanity is Magical. Destroy Followers of the Lie. Democracy Seeks the Truth.'</span></i><br /> 2. Greetings of guests from other Caucuses or Orders - they all are ALWAYS allowed, even when they do not have voting right.<br /> 3. Official recognition on new Voters and voting on promotions on titles and positions within Assembly.<br /> 4. Discussion of current situation o War on Lie in member Consillia. Planning maneuvers by voting or choosing Strategos for the job.<br /> 5. Any rites local Assembly likes to uphold.<br /> 6. Sum up of actions done by Legacies connected to Assembly<br /> 7. Unofficial part \u2013 party and networking, like sharing Rotes or Mentors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-15-2017, 12:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value